@baseUrl = http://localhost:5800
@token = 请先调用登录接口并把返回的token粘贴到这里

### 后端健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 学生登录（密码请使用根目录 .env 中的 DEMO_PASSWORD）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "zhangsan",
  "password": "请在本机填写"
}

### 大模型学习闭环状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-learning/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 学习闭环数据概览
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-learning/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 上传学生个人资料
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/personal-knowledge/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "数据结构第四章讲义",
  "fileName": "chapter-4.md",
  "mimeType": "text/markdown",
  "subject": "数据结构",
  "contentText": "# 红黑树\n\n在这里粘贴学生有权使用的资料正文。"
}

### 查看知识图谱与资源框架
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/graph?subject=数据结构
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 在助手中分析文字错题
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "请识别并分析这道错题",
  "wrongQuestion": {
    "subject": "数据结构",
    "questionText": "红黑树左旋后中序遍历次序是否改变？",
    "studentAnswer": "会改变",
    "correctAnswer": "不会改变"
  }
}

### 生成融合路径、错题、对话、私有资料和联网题源的个性化测验
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quiz/personalized/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "数据结构",
  "knowledgePoint": "红黑树",
  "questionCount": 8,
  "difficulty": "提高"
}

### 查看到期滚动复习任务
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/review/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 提交复习效果（quality 为 0 到 5）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/review/queue/1/result
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quality": 4
}

### 学习路径使用所有闭环数据重新生成
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/path/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 清晰的资源分类与接口衔接
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resources/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
